Manual Operations

Beyond the available buttons on the user interface, there are two additional functionality the user is capable of:

Resizing:

The widgets can be resized both vertically and horizontally by dragging any of their arbitrary border. When hovering over the borders with the mouse, you should see the following mouse icon:

Unlike with the buttons for setting their size, both the width and the height can be set. Furthermore, there are no restrictions on either the minimum or maximum size.

Dragging:

Widgets can be reordered by dragging them to a new position within the layout. To do this, hover over the widget you want to move, click and hold it by the header (mouse icon), then drag it to the desired location. As you drag, the layout will dynamically adjust to show where the widget can be placed. Once it is in the right spot, simply release the mouse button to drop it there.

