+ N' quote after  ticking the ‘is final’ field, simply untick the field and  all other fields should become editable again . Exception to this is when  a quote   has already generated the required jobs , in which case the enquiry cannot be edited anymore.
To create a job, we must first     generate from   a n accepted  quote. Locate the desired quote. Click the “Tasks” button and select “Create Jobs”. Upon successful creation, you will find the job under the “Jobs” section. Once open, fill all the required fields , and then save the record. | Figure  67  - Job Page
